#: kfritz.desktop:7
msgctxt "Comment"
msgid ""
"Access call history and phone book of your Fritz!Box and get notifications "
"on incoming and outgoing calls."
msgstr ""
"Pristupite ranijim pozivima i telefonskom imeniku vašeg Fritz! Box  dobijte "
"informacije o dolaznim i odlaznim pozivima."

